            "image_width": 100,
            "image_mask": "none",
            "align_text": "left",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p><br/><strong>What is Saleable Condition?</strong></p><p>If the returned product(s) show any of the below conditions, then it is not in saleable condition and a restocking fee may be charged, partial refund, or no refund.</p><ul><li>Damage caused during installation</li><li>Missing parts or the original product packing material</li><li>Damage because the item was improperly packaged for return shipment</li><li>A different serial number than the item that was originally shipped</li><li>Retro Manufacturing reserves the right to determine if the product is in saleable condition.</li></ul><h4><strong>Items that are non-refundable:</strong></h4><ul><li>Knobs, bezels, faceplates purchased individually</li><li>Shipping charges</li><li>Gift cards</li><li>Package protection if the item has already been shipped</li></ul>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
